    "detailed_description": "Multiplayer Spiders<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou and Your steam spider friends must stop the invading spiders from spinning their web of fear<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game includes a Multiplayer &amp; Single Player system.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can Invite Your Steam Friends with the ' + ' Icon on the Main Menu !<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* NOTE : You should have a Stable &amp; Fast Internet Connection for Best Results *<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nShoot Webs<br />\r\nAttack Invading Spiders<br />\r\nCollect Plus Icons to add to Your Progress<br />\r\nDon't Disturb the Humans as You Crawl Around<br />\r\nFind Your Way in the Vast Environment<br />\r\nUse Your Webs to get to Challenging Places<br />\r\nMaster the Complex Controls of using ALL 8 legs to navigate<br />\r\n(HINT: Use both LOOK and MOVE, think like a Bumper Car)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow Many &quot;Easter Eggs&quot; can You find?",
